    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d561">

                <pb facs="1022" n="982" sameAs="frus:frus1951v05/pg982"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">785.00/7–2051: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Jordan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Drew</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Department of State
                    </hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d561-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">niact</hi>
                        
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Amman</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-07-20T13:00:00+02:00">July 20, 1951—1
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>26. Legtel 25, July 20.<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d561-f2"/> Death of Abdullah,
                    mental condition and absence from country of Crown Prince
                        Tallal, and minority of Tallal’s
                    son Hussain, pose immed serious constitutional problem
                    regarding succession on which too early to comment.</p>
                <p>Legion enforcing martial law immed. Police guards on foreign Legs being
                    strengthened. I am taking all possible precautions assure safety of Amer
                    personnel and residents and Leg property. Amer staff member will be on duty at
                    chancery 24 hours day. While confident ability Arab Legion maintain order I do
                    not exclude possibility disorders by irresponsible elements including refugees
                    with anti-foreign overtones.</p>
                <p>Have informed Amer Con branch [in] Arab-held Jerusalem requesting it do likewise
                    and keep Dept and me promptly and fully informed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Drew</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d561-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d561-f1-content">
                <p>Repeated to Beirut, Baghdad, Cairo, Jidda, Damascus, London, Paris, Tel Aviv, and
                    Jerusalem.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d561-f2" n="2" xml:id="d561-f2-content">
                <p>Not printed; it conveyed the following message to Washington, repeated to
                    Baghdad, Beirut, Cairo, Damascus, Jidda, London, Paris, and Tel Aviv: King
                        Abdullah assassinated about noon July
                    20, at mosque Jerusalem.” (785.11/7–2051)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
